(ns association.facts
  "Industry rule/history catalog for SOFOFA (Sociedad de Fomento Fabril,
  Chile), an industry-association-level source per ADR-2607141700
  (cloud-itonami-compliance-fact-federation), aligned to ISIC 9411
  (activities of business, employers, and professional membership
  organizations). Chile has real, individually verified facts across
  all three axes: country (cloud-itonami-iso3166-chl statute.facts),
  municipality (cloud-itonami-municipality-chl-santiago), and
  association (this entry).

  Sources: documents SOFOFA serves from www.sofofa.cl -- its 2024
  statute, 2018 Ethics Charter, councillors' Code of Conduct, Ethics
  Commission regulation and site pages -- plus the Subsecretaria de
  Economia registry certificate SOFOFA republishes, each declared per
  entry by :url-provenance.

  GENERATED by scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk from data/datascript-tx.edn,
  together with the Kotoba port in src/association_facts.kotoba. Do not
  hand-edit; add facts to the data file and regenerate.

  Every entry carries the page it came from (:source-article) and the
  verbatim span the claim rests on (:source-quote), and
  `kbb --backend sci scripts/verify-catalog.cljk --live` fetches each :url and requires
  that span to still be in it. Reachability is not support: a URL that
  returns 200 without the claim reads exactly like one that carries it.

  No personal names of office-holders are persisted here.

  An association not in `catalog` has NO spec-basis, full stop; never
  fabricate one."
  (:require [clojure.string]))

(def catalog
  "association-slug -> vector of association-rule entries."
